  "prefLabel": "Jus 812.02 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 812.02 Standard and Burden of Proof. The party asserting a proposition shall bear the burden of proving the truth of the proposition by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00",
